    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The kiln is back on after the winter break. We loaded <strong>forty pieces</strong> from the January course.</p>
<h2>What we changed</h2>
<ul><li>A slower climb through 600°C</li><li>New shelf posts</li></ul>
<p><img src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64jun1per/kiln-shelf.jpg" alt="A loaded kiln shelf" /></p>
<p>Read the <a href="https://www.juniperceramics.example/journal/glaze-notes">glaze notes</a>.</p>
<iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/123456789" width="640" height="360"></iframe>]]></content:encoded>
